1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,040
Woman: So are you all set for the picnic tomorrow?

2
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:11,860
Man: Not quite. I still need to pick up some snacks

3
00:00:11,860 --> 00:00:14,110
and drinks and maybe a few extra napkins.

4
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:17,230
Woman: Want some help? I was planning to go to the store later anyway.

5
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:20,520
Man: That'd be perfect. I need to make a fruit salad

6
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:23,040
and I'm worried I don't have enough time.

7
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:27,090
Woman: Well, it's not until the afternoon, right? And we don't have to go far.

8
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:30,150
Man: That's true. I shouldn't worry so much.
